---
/**
 * Hero section: large headline + subheadline.
 */
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero__headline text-taupe-950 pb-16 text-balance transition ">
    Hi, I'm Jake. <br />
    <span class="text-taupe-500">I'm a </span>product designer <span class="text-taupe-500">based in</span>
    <span class="text-green-700">Philadelphia</span>, Pennsylvania.
  </h1>
  <p class="hero__subheadline text-taupe-600">
    <!-- Welcome to my spot on the internet. -->
  </p>
  <p class="hero__subheadline text-taupe-950 text-pretty">
    This is where I share my work and some of my personal hobbies like <a class="underline decoration-green-700/40 hover:decoration-green-700" href="">jiu jitsu</a>, <a class="underline decoration-green-700/40 hover:decoration-green-700" href="">reading</a>, and <a class="underline decoration-green-700/40 hover:decoration-green-700" href="">film</a>.
    </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .hero__headline {
    font-family: "Fraunces Variable", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-variation-settings: "WONK" 0, "SOFT" 100;
    font-optical-sizing: auto;
    font-size: clamp(2.00rem, calc(1.091rem + 4.545dvw), 4.50rem);
    line-height: 1.10;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero__subheadline {
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  
  .hero__subheadline a {
    color: var(--color-green-700);
    text-decoration-thickness: .15ex;
    text-underline-offset: .15ex;
  }
</style>
